    character2: {fileID: 3825917228853779581, guid: 715adfd12147dc1479155bff01c07e0a, type: 3}
    name: Liezel
    soundToPlay: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cfd43b09479e4b35a0341f36b492e9b, type: 3}
    audioPitchOffset: 0
    font: {fileID: 0}
    textSpeed: 0.024
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - 'Yes, I believe that would be the best course of action. If it turns out to
      be nothing of note, then we can free the Disidensiya from suspicion.

'
    - I want to believe that the Disidensiya is not hiding anything from me, but
      if I want to get to the bottom of this, I ought to be ready to learn anything.
    - Please continue investigating the area. I will head back and see if I can uncover
      more information.
