  dialogue:
    character: {fileID: -3929998360153519, guid: 7768e6cd5d1d84ba3b1a2c94654bef5d, type: 3}
    character2: {fileID: 3825917228853779581, guid: 715adfd12147dc1479155bff01c07e0a, type: 3}
    name: Liezel
    soundToPlay: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cfd43b09479e4b35a0341f36b492e9b, type: 3}
    audioPitchOffset: 0
    font: {fileID: 0}
    textSpeed: 0.024
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - "Haha, I have not forgotten. As it happens, my sister left me a manuscript
      of her and Servillano\u2019s magic research. "
    - I want to take another look for the sake of this investigation, but it also
      contains information that might be of interest to you.
    - About an ore called <b>Salakab</b>.
    - <start_shake><start_dim>THE END OF LEVEL 1 WOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO<end_shake>
    - <end_dim> ok we go level 2 now... L2 envis are activated. my fellow testers,
      I recommend u read thru Level 2 LDD while playing
